; Key names shown on the controls screen
;
; Eight characters of the names of the keys JUMP, CROUCH, LEFT, RIGHT in that order (QAOP at start-up; ENTER, SPACE,
; CAPS SHIFT and SYMBOL SHIFT take two letters), blank-filled; rewritten by #R$A336 (blanked) and #R$A3F6 (appended).
; Followed by the $80 that ends the script #R$A4DD.
@label=KeyNames
g$A4F2 DEFM "QAOP    "
 $A4FA DEFB $80      ; end of script #R$A4DD
